@startuml
title 用户在指定板块发布图文帖顺序图

actor User
participant PostUI
participant PostController
participant UserStatusChecker
participant ContentReviewSystem
database PostDB
participant SectionManager

User -> PostUI : 1. inputPostContent(title, content, media)
User -> PostUI : 2. selectPostSection(sectionId)

User -> PostUI : 3. submitPost(content, sectionId)

PostUI -> PostController : submitPost(content, sectionId)

PostController -> UserStatusChecker : 4. checkLoginStatus(userId)
UserStatusChecker --> PostController : 5. returnLoginStatus(status)

alt 已登录
    PostController -> ContentReviewSystem : 6. reviewPostContent(content)
    ContentReviewSystem --> PostController : 7. returnReviewResult(result)

    alt 审核通过
        PostController -> PostDB : 8. savePostInfo(userId, content, sectionId, media)
        PostController -> SectionManager : 9. updateSectionStats(sectionId)
        PostDB --> PostController : 10. returnPostResult(postId)
        PostController -> PostUI : 11. showPostSuccess(postId, section)
    else 需修改
        PostController -> PostUI : 提示内容需修改
    end
else 未登录
    PostController -> PostUI : 提示用户先登录
end

PostUI --> User : 显示发帖结果 / 跳转帖子详情页

@enduml
